        <semantic:textAnnotation id="_d3fdc73b-1a34-4a74-9ac6-9d0bef887f7b">
            <semantic:text>This lesson teaches process modularity and reuse. The same “Verify Driver Background” subprocess can be called from other parent workflows—such as:

Driver Annual Re-Verification Process
Incident Review Process (Post-Complaint)
Reactivation After Suspension

Learners see how BPMN mirrors real software design—one defined logic serving multiple use cases.</semantic:text>
        </semantic:textAnnotation>
    </semantic:process>
